KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
JAMB - Physics (Year 2023)

Q1. A capacitor of capacitance 4 microfarads is connected across 100V. Calculate stored energy.
  (A) 0.02 J
  (B) 0.04 J
  (C) 0.08 J
  (D) 0.20 J
  Answer: A - E = 0.5 * C * V^2 = 0.5 * (4e-6) * (100^2) = 0.02 Joules.


